{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The restriction attaches to a distributor's act of offering a gift. The quoted text does not additionally require the distributor to fund or fulfil it.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Separately identifiable benefit components are assessed separately; boundaries require judgment where benefits cannot reliably be separated.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Gift status requires substantive assessment. Guaranteed returns and other incentives are not automatically gifts merely because paragraph 9 says they may be considered gifts.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The fee or charge discount exception applies to the assessed component itself, not every benefit packaged with a discount.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Product-type promotion includes funds identified by fund type or fund house.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The words 'should not offer' are modeled as a prohibition under this selected restriction, without determining criminal liability or granting legal approval.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"801b24549fa0e9c033373a4ab755488af02666c6a11f6b666c01ac2aefa244e8","candidate_id":"candidate.ef9617c1b03543be9082d8450c6ebabf","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_PROHIBITED] Within distributor scope, the result answers whether this actor's offering of this component to this client falls within the selected gift prohibition. True means the actor offers a gift that is not itself a fee or charge discount and has the specified product or product-type promotional connection, irrespective of who funds or fulfils it. False means that conjunction is not met for this component; it does not approve the combined offer. Unknown facts remain unknown unless other inputs determine the expression.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.9d3ffeba66184f6dbab240ceb8be2250","issue.e9e57203356d4de79c1702c4c4297bdd","issue.2be174c359cb48bea8a36198fc50927a","issue.25c0380958dd424bafbbed00d59ee5fa","issue.f9c815487b4842cc86953ca51e0cb26f","issue.8ab91745c22f4ae4a3ef4bcf0d926344"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"The prior component model abstraction.ea48395ee1fc075eb75b04b4 describes the distributor as the provider and places provider_is_distributor in scope. If 'provider' means the funder or fulfiller, that vocabulary can exclude a gift offered by a distributor but supplied by another person. This proposal separates offering from funding and fulfilment. It is a consequential correction to that possible narrowing, while remaining compatible with abstraction.933486dc69f18e0075717cc1's offeror-based scope. Neither third-party funding nor any actual third-party arrangement is assumed.","run_id":"run.5536e2694ccd404aa5c8cf55fdd1443e","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"9cc272f84dbcec164f1a7a7a567859d8a6feb7fc34af22d7bef3e7688f64f736","source_unit_ids":["db43e253bea18.u12.2646","db43e253bea18.u13.2987","db43e253bea18.u7.1360"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Attribution of the gift offer separately from funding or fulfilment"}